This setup creates a Lumen application with an endpoint `/decideUnsubscribe` that processes raw email content to determine if a user has requested to unsubscribe from a mailing list. The application extracts the email address and checks for specific unsubscribe keywords in the email content. The response is returned in JSON format. 

